  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1. 一个长方形长1.2分米，宽0.3分米，求长方形的面积.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了求出长方形面积，需要把它的长乘以宽：$1.2\\cdot0.3=0.36$(平方分米).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. 一个长方形长$\\frac{1}{2}$分米，宽$\\frac{1}{3}$分米，求长方形的面积.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从图148中可以看出，把1平方分米的正方形的一边分成二等份，把另一边分成三等份. 因此在1平方分米中包括有6个这样的长方形. 就是说，一个长方形等于1平方分米的$\\frac{1}{6}$. 所以面积等于$\\frac{1}{6}$平方分米.第二题的内容与第一题相同. 解第一题是用1.2和0.3相乘. 因此认为第二题的答案$\\left(\\frac{1}{6}\\right)$也是$\\frac{1}{2}$和$\\frac{1}{3}$的积：$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#6",
        "p0191#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-148",
      "label": "图 148",
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图148",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 148",
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例3. 一个长方形长$\\frac{2}{3}$分米，宽$\\frac{4}{5}$分米，求长方形面积.从图149中看出，长方形是这样得到的：把1平方分米的正方形分成$15(3\\cdot5=15)$等份并取其中的$8(2\\cdot4=8)$等份. 因此，长方形的面积等于$\\frac{8}{15}$平方分米. 在这种情况下，可以认为这个长方形的面积是用$\\frac{2}{3}$和$\\frac{4}{5}$相乘求得的：$\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{2\\cdot4}{3\\cdot5}=\\frac{8}{15}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 182,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0191#10",
        "p0192#1",
        "p0192#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-149",
      "label": "图 149",
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图149",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 149",
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "就是说，为了求出两个分数乘积的分子，必须使两个分数的分子相乘，而要求出两个分数乘积的分母，必须使两个分数的分母相乘.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**两个分数的乘积等于以两个分数的分子乘积为分子和以****两个分数的分母乘积为分母的分数.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个法则也可以应用于自然数和分数相乘. 为此，只要把自然数化成分数再使用分数乘法法则就可以了.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如：$9\\cdot\\frac{6}{11}=\\frac{9}{1}\\cdot\\frac{6}{11}=\\frac{54}{11}=4\\frac{10}{11}$；$\\frac{5}{8}\\cdot7=\\frac{5}{8}\\cdot\\frac{7}{1}=\\frac{35}{8}=4\\frac{3}{8}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果两个分数的乘积是可约分数，最好先写成分子和分母分别相乘的形式，约简后，再相乘.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如：$\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot\\frac{14}{5}=\\frac{4\\cdot14}{7\\cdot5}=\\frac{4\\cdot2}{5}=\\frac{8}{5}=1\\frac{3}{5}$；$\\frac{3}{8}\\cdot\\frac{4}{15}=\\frac{3\\cdot4}{8\\cdot15}=\\frac{1}{2\\cdot5}=\\frac{1}{10}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 183,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0192#10",
        "p0193#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**分数乘法满足交换律和结合律.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "运用分数乘法也可以解用自然数乘法解的问题.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例4. 一公斤面粉值$\\frac{11}{25}$卢布，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤面粉值多少卢布？",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "解这样自然数或者小数的应用题，我们过去是用乘法.现在我们也用乘法解这道题：$\\frac{11}{25}\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{33}{100}$（卢布）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "结果，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤面粉值$\\frac{33}{100}$卢布，也就是33戈比. 让我们来验算所得答案. 价格用戈比表示：$\\frac{11}{25}$卢布$=44$戈比.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这就是$\\frac{1}{4}$公斤面粉的价格是11戈比$(44:4=11)$，$\\frac{3}{4}$公斤面粉的价格是33戈比$(11\\cdot3=33)$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例5. 一块地的面积是8公顷. 求这块地的$\\frac{3}{4}$的面积.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这块地的$\\frac{1}{4}$的面积等于$8:4=2$（公顷），而$\\frac{3}{4}$的面积等于$2\\cdot3=6$（公顷）. 如果把8乘以$\\frac{3}{4}$也可以得出同样的答案，即$8\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=6$（公顷）. 就是说，为了求某数的$\\frac{3}{4}$，应当用$\\frac{3}{4}$乘这个数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例6. $3\\frac{2}{5}$乘以2. 因为$3\\frac{2}{5}=3+\\frac{2}{5}$，所以$3\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot2=(3+\\frac{2}{5})\\cdot2=3\\cdot2+\\frac{2}{5}\\cdot2=6+\\frac{4}{5}=6\\frac{4}{5}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 184,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0193#10",
        "p0194#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
